%SIXMD 1
# @?EXPR - EVALUATE AN INTEGER EXPRESSION

## @?OPERANDS

### @?STRING...
STRING... OPERAND.

## DESCRIPTION

EXPR EVALUATES BOUNDED INTEGER ARITHMETIC AND COMPARISONS.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
